{"step_index":24,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-15T06:18:18Z","input_tokens":2554,"cache_read_tokens":69169,"output_tokens":2158,"content":"I have built a modern, mobile-friendly website for **Vetri Apex Academy**, a premier coaching centre in Chennai specializing in **NEET-UG, IIT-JEE, Foundation (Class 8–10), and TNPSC**.\n\nThe project is located in:\n📁 `C:/Users/Muralidharan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/chennai-coaching-website`\n\n> **Recommendation**: Set `C:\\Users\\Muralidharan\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\chennai-coaching-website` as your active workspace in Antigravity for seamless project navigation.\n\n---\n\n### 📂 Created Files & Project Structure\n\n- [index.html](file:///C:/Users/Muralidharan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/chennai-coaching-website/index.html): Semantic, high-converting single-page application structure.\n- [css/styles.css](file:///C:/Users/Muralidharan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/chennai-coaching-website/css/styles.css): Complete responsive CSS design system (Deep Navy `#0A1E3F`, Amber Gold `#F59E0B`, Emerald Green `#059669`, glassmorphism cards, micro-interactions, mobile drawer, and bottom navigation bar).\n- [js/main.js](file:///C:/Users/Muralidharan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/chennai-coaching-website/js/main.js): Interactive course filters, V-SAT scholarship fee calculator, campus tab switcher, live form validation with reference ID generator, syllabus download simulator, and dynamic WhatsApp messaging.\n- [README.md](file:///C:/Users/Muralidharan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/chennai-coaching-website/README.md): Documentation with running options and customization instructions.\n\n---\n\n### 🌟 Key Features Built\n\n1. **Header & Navigation**:\n   - Sticky glassmorphic navbar with logo, announcement ticker, call hotline (`+91 98401 23456`), and Chennai campus highlights (**Anna Nagar | T. Nagar | Tambaram | Adyar**).\n   - Dedicated mobile navigation drawer with hamburger toggle.\n\n2. **Hero Section with High Impact**:\n   - Bold headline tailored to Chennai students: *\"Empowering Chennai's Brightest Minds for NEET, JEE & Board Excellence\"*.\n   - Trust metrics: **14,500+** students mentored, **98.4%** pass rate, **1,280+** Govt. Medical & IIT admits, **4.9/5** Google rating.\n   - Dual CTAs: *Explore Courses*, *Book 3-Day Free Demo*, and *Quick WhatsApp Enquiry*.\n   - Floating **Instant Callback Card** right on the hero banner.\n\n3. **Courses Section (with Interactive Filtering)**:\n   - Filter tabs: **Medical (NEET-UG & Repeaters)**, **Engineering (IIT-JEE Main + Advanced)**, **Foundation (Class 8–10 Olympiad)**, and **Civil Services (TNPSC Group 1 & 2)**.\n   - Each course card includes duration, eligibility, bilingual medium support (Tamil & English), key highlights, *\"Download Syllabus\"* modal trigger, and *\"Enquire Now\"* button that auto-selects the course in the enquiry form.\n\n4. **Why Choose Vetri & 4-Stage Learning Formula**:\n   - Master faculty from IIT Madras & AIIMS, 1:20 mentor-student ratio, 24/7 air-conditioned study libraries, parent tracking app, and All-Tamil Nadu mock test rank analytics.\n\n5. **Interactive V-SAT Scholarship Fee Estimator**:\n   - Live percentage slider calculating tuition fee waivers (up to 100% waiver for 95%+ scorers) with immediate qualification status.\n\n6. **Chennai Toppers & Results Hall of Fame**:\n   - Authentic Chennai student profiles (DAV Chennai, PSBB K.K. Nagar, Chettinad Vidyashram, MMC Chennai admits, Stanley admits, and TNPSC Deputy Collector rankers).\n\n7. **About Us Section**:\n   - Founded in 2012 by IIT Madras alumni, featuring Academic Director Dr. K. Ramanathan's message, campus tour highlights, and hostel facility support for outstation Tamil Nadu students.\n\n8. **Chennai Campus Locator**:\n   - Interactive tab switcher for **Anna Nagar (HQ)**, **T. Nagar**, **Tambaram West**, and **Adyar** with exact metro proximity (e.g., 300m from Anna Nagar Tower Metro), branch hotlines, and one-click Google Maps links.\n\n9. **Comprehensive Student Admission & Enquiry Form**:\n   - Client-side validation for Indian 10-digit mobile numbers (`^[6-9]\\d{9}$`), email format, course, and campus selection.\n   - Generates an official reference code (`#VA-2026-XXXX`), saves to `localStorage`, and displays an interactive **Success Modal** with a one-click button to continue the enquiry directly in WhatsApp with pre-filled details.\n\n10. **Dedicated WhatsApp Integrations**:\n    - **Floating WhatsApp button** at bottom-right with animated pulse, online indicator, and dismissible tooltip.\n    - **Header WhatsApp button** with quick-start conversation.\n    - **Mobile Sticky Bottom Bar** (`Call Centre` | `WhatsApp` | `Enquire Now`) permanently docked for mobile visitors.\n\n11. **Interactive FAQ Accordion**:\n    - Smooth expand/collapse answering top parent questions regarding hostel stay, bilingual teaching in Tamil/English, weekend batches, and EMI options.\n\n---\n\n### 🚀 How to View the Website\n\n- **Direct Open**: Open [index.html](file:///C:/Users/Muralidharan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/chennai-coaching-website/index.html) directly in any browser (Chrome, Edge, Firefox).\n- **Via Local Server**:\n  ```powershell\n  cd C:\\Users\\Muralidharan\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\chennai-coaching-website\n  python -m http.server 3000\n  ```\n  Then visit `http://localhost:3000` in your browser.","thinking":"Initial assessment: Both CSS and JavaScript files exhibit clean syntax, eliminating immediate concerns about basic coding errors. Focusing now on user requirements, the objective is to build a modern, mobile-friendly website for the Chennai coaching center, Vetri Apex Academy. The site must include specific sections: Home (with metrics and calls-to-action), Courses (including Medical options), About, Contact, a student inquiry form, and a WhatsApp button.\n\n\nThe website structure must include sections for Home, Courses (Medical, Engineering, Foundation, Civil Services), About, and Contact, alongside a student inquiry form and WhatsApp integration. \"About\" section should detail the center's history, leadership, faculty, and infrastructure. The \"Contact\" section needs helpline information, branch details, and metro route graphics. The student inquiry form requires validation and a reference ID generator.\n\nColor palette will be Deep Royal Navy, Amber Gold, Vibrant Teal/Emerald, and Slate. Realistic Chennai-specific content needs to be incorporated.\n\n\n"}
